<title>ITALY: GROSS YIELD RISES AT ITALY 18-MO CTZ BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>GROSS YIELD RISES AT ITALY 18-MO CTZ BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 1.5 trillion lire auction of a seventh tranche of 18-month December 30, 1998 Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ), and 1.5 trillion lire auction of a fifth tranche of July 15, 1999 two-year CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Dec 30, 98  Pvs    July 15, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.49 pct    5.32   5.43 pct    5.27</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.24	  6.06   6.14	  5.99</p>
<p>Assigned price 92.00	 92.00  89.20	 89.25</p>
<p>Bids	     2.48 trillion lire   3.10 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 1.50 trillion lire   1.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The results compared with those at the previous July 28 auctions.</p>
</text>
